  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3207.01 Marketable Emissions Authorizations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3207.01 Marketable Emissions Authorizations. Allowances shall be marketable emissions authorizations that can be bought, sold, or traded at any time during any year, not just the current year.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
